###

### SUPER_ADMIN can access admin area
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/test
Authorization: Bearer {{super_admin_token}}

###

### ADMIN can access students
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### DIRECTOR can access students
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{director_token}}

###

### TEACHER can access students
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

###

### Missing JWT should return 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students

###

### ADMIN area with ADMIN token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/test
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### ADMIN area with FINANCE token should return 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/test
Authorization: Bearer {{finance_token}}

###

### ADMIN area with DIRECTOR token should return 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/test
Authorization: Bearer {{director_token}}

###

### DIRECTOR area with ADMIN token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/director/test
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### DIRECTOR area with DIRECTOR token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/director/test
Authorization: Bearer {{director_token}}

###

### DIRECTOR area with TEACHER token should return 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/director/test
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

###

### Get student by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Create student
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "studentCode": "STU-010",
  "firstName": "Mateo",
  "lastName": "Garcia",
  "birthDate": "2020-05-10",
  "groupId": 1,
  "status": "active",
  "enrollmentDate": "2026-04-29",
  "medicalNotes": "Sin notas medicas",
  "allergies": null,
  "notes": "Nuevo estudiante"
}

###

### Update student
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "studentCode": "STU-001",
  "firstName": "Lucas",
  "lastName": "Andersson",
  "birthDate": "2020-04-12",
  "groupId": 1,
  "status": "active",
  "enrollmentDate": "2026-01-15",
  "medicalNotes": "No major medical issues",
  "allergies": null,
  "notes": "Actualizado desde Spring Boot"
}

###

### Delete student
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/students/3
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
